        "uuid": "d6d09384_363aa437",
        "filename": "android/package.go",
        "patchSetId": 9
      },
      "lineNbr": 84,
      "author": {
        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-25T20:14:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It can\u0027t be done by supplying \"//\"+depDir as the name in at visibility.go:416 instead? The reason I ask is that it\u0027d be cleaner to avoid a special case in qualifiedModuleId() if other code starts to use it via the android.Module interface.",
